            "kind": "TRIVIAL_REBASE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector/cplddump",
                    "line": 14,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can we make this more descriptive?  There are actually at least 2 or 3 different CPLDs, so we should probably be clear which one this is.\n\nI think this is the \"ventura-rmc-cpld-dump.log\".  There is a second CPLD on the Ventura SCM.\n\n```\nrecipes-phosphor/settings/phosphor-settings-defaults-native/ventura-temporary-software-versions.yaml\n1:/xyz/openbmc_project/software/chassis/Ventura_SCM_cpld:\n17:/xyz/openbmc_project/software/chassis/Ventura_RMC_cpld_cfg0:\n25:/xyz/openbmc_project/software/chassis/Ventura_RMC_cpld_cfg1:\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector/cplddump",
                    "line": 14,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector_%.bbappend",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This should be `do_install:append()`.  You don't need a special postfunc for this, which is probably part of the issue with needing the extra Python business."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector_%.bbappend",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
